<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="col-10 offset-1 col-lg-8 offset-lg-2" style="padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;">
  <span class="section-eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>Legal</span>
  <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="listing-meta mb-4">Last updated: January 2025</p>

  <div class="policy-body">

    <h4>1. Who we are</h4>
    <p>YatraStay ("we", "us", "our") is an online marketplace connecting travellers with hosts across Southeast Asia and the wider Asian region. References to "YatraStay Private Limited" in this document refer to the same entity.</p>

    <h4>2. What information we collect</h4>
    <p>We collect information you give us directly:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account information</strong> — username and email address when you register.</li>
      <li><strong>Listing information</strong> — title, description, location, price, and images when you create a listing.</li>
      <li><strong>Booking information</strong> — check-in and check-out dates and guest count when you make a reservation.</li>
      <li><strong>Reviews</strong> — ratings and comments you leave on listings.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We also collect limited technical information automatically, such as your IP address and browser type, to keep the service secure.</p>

    <h4>3. How we use your information</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>To operate and improve the YatraStay platform.</li>
      <li>To facilitate bookings between guests and hosts.</li>
      <li>To send transactional messages (booking confirmations, account notices).</li>
      <li>To detect and prevent fraud or abuse.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

    <h4>4. Image uploads and Cloudinary</h4>
    <p>Listing images are stored with Cloudinary, Inc. Images you upload are subject to <a href="https://cloudinary.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudinary's privacy policy</a>. Please do not upload images containing personal information about other people without their consent.</p>

    <h4>5. Cookies and sessions</h4>
    <p>We use a single session cookie to keep you logged in. It expires after seven days of inactivity. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

    <h4>6. Data retention</h4>
    <p>We keep your account data for as long as your account is active. Booking records are retained for a minimum of one year for financial and dispute-resolution purposes. You may request deletion of your account by contacting us.</p>

    <h4>7. Your rights</h4>
    <p>Depending on where you are located, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete the personal data we hold about you. To exercise these rights, contact us at the address below.</p>

    <h4>8. Security</h4>
    <p>We use industry-standard measures to protect your data, including encrypted connections (HTTPS), hashed passwords, and HTTP security headers. No system is perfectly secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

    <h4>9. Changes to this policy</h4>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will note the date of the most recent revision at the top of this page. Continued use of YatraStay after a change constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>

    <h4>10. Contact</h4>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Reach us at <a href="mailto:privacy@yatrastay.com">privacy@yatrastay.com</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <a href="/" class="btn btn-dark mt-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-2"></i>Back to home</a>
</div>

